# =====================================================================
# Release V033 -- plain-English metric definitions (in-product glossary)
# =====================================================================
# Adds Config.Metric_Definitions.Long_Description and populates a full plain-English
# definition for every metric, so the web app (and, later, PBI) can surface a glossary
# the end user can read when a metric is ambiguous.
#
#   Config.Metric_Definitions    -- gains Long_Description (guarded ALTER, V033 migration).
#                                   Seed MERGE fills Long_Description for all metrics and
#                                   realigns the deposit_ratio short text to its real calc.
#
# Web follow-up (deploy-dev/prod.yml on Web/** push): /api/definitions endpoint +
# Definitions help panel grouped by section (Home = all sections).
#
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V033__metric_long_description.manifest
# =====================================================================

MIGRATE  Migrations\V033__metric_definitions_long_description.sql

DEPLOY   Fabric\Config.Metric_Definitions.Data.sql

TEST
